From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pb01ka <gaganpb08singh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rules_ml_toolchain: add clang 22 max PTX version

local_config_cuda comes from the external @rules_ml_toolchain repo (see
WORKSPACE), whose gpu/cuda/cuda_redist_versions.bzl PTX_VERSION_DICT at
TF 2.21.0's pinned commit (d8cb9c2) only maps clang majors 14-21. With
the feedstock's clang 22 pin, repository setup fails at option loading:

  Cuda Configuration Error: The supported Clang versions are
  ["14", ..., "21"]. Please add max PTX version supported by Clang
  major version=22.

Add "22": "9.0" -- the exact value rules_ml_toolchain upstream added at
HEAD (verified, not guessed). Delivered as a patch_file on the
rules_ml_toolchain tf_http_archive in WORKSPACE (same mechanism as
third_party/llvm's patches; tf_http_archive applies patch_file entries
with ctx.patch(strip=1)), with the inner diff added as
third_party/rules_ml_toolchain.patch.
---
--- a/WORKSPACE
+++ b/WORKSPACE
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@
 # Details: https://github.com/google-ml-infra/rules_ml_toolchain
 tf_http_archive(
     name = "rules_ml_toolchain",
+    patch_file = ["//third_party:rules_ml_toolchain.patch"],
     sha256 = "54c1a357f71f611efdb4891ebd4bcbe4aeb6dfa7e473f14fd7ecad5062096616",
     strip_prefix = "rules_ml_toolchain-d8cb9c2c168cd64000eaa6eda0781a9615a26ffe",
     urls = tf_mirror_urls(
--- /dev/null
+++ b/third_party/rules_ml_toolchain.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+diff --git a/gpu/cuda/cuda_redist_versions.bzl b/gpu/cuda/cuda_redist_versions.bzl
+--- a/gpu/cuda/cuda_redist_versions.bzl
++++ b/gpu/cuda/cuda_redist_versions.bzl
+@@ -516,6 +516,7 @@ PTX_VERSION_DICT = {
+         "18": "8.3",
+         "19": "8.5",
+         "20": "8.7",
+         "21": "8.8",
++        "22": "9.0",
+     },
+     # To find, look at https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-thread-execution/index.html#release-notes
+     "cuda": {
